Project: Trapnex

Backend:
Node.js
Express
MongoDB
Websocket

Frontend:
React
Vite

Rules:
- Do not create duplicate files.
- Follow existing folder structure.
- Use async/await.
- Use Javascript & TypeScript standards.
- Explain before large changes.
- Do not edit .env files.
- If you create a new API route, add it to the .rest file.
